1
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,600
The sage asked for the boy.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,000
The king heard it and lost himself.

3
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,800
He had waited a long time for this son.

4
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:23,400
He said the boy was not yet sixteen.

5
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,600
He offered his army instead. And himself.

6
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,800
The sage waited.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
He said no.
